    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Scalability and IP risks, okay. Nothing too crazy there. I just want to be 100% sure on the technical side before I present this to the board. Take a closer look at the enzyme stability data in the lab reports—specifically the degradation rates over 48 hours. Does anything stand out there that might be a red flag for the long-term efficacy of the product?",
